From 55c8bcc62b374c09d6a23593b9d7ea34527cd50a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 19:38:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(packaging): the logotype in the exe, installer, .icns
 and Linux icons

Packaging scripts read assets/logo/icons (cargo xtask logo) instead of
cube.png; the installer sets SetupIconFile; crates/ui/build.rs embeds the
.ico in the Windows exe through winresource (new build dependency).

Fixes #1461

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
